[module Queries('http://example.com')]

[query square(n : Integer) : Integer = n * n/]

[query cube(n : Integer) : Integer = n * n * n/]

[query isEven(n : Integer) : Boolean = (n - (n / 2) * 2) = 0/]

[query fullName(first : String, last : String) : String =
  first + ' ' + last/]

[query greeting(name : String) : String =
  'Hello, ' + name + '!'/]

[template main()]
=== MTL Query Examples ===

1. Mathematical Queries:
   Square of 5: [square(5)/]
   Cube of 3: [cube(3)/]

2. Boolean Queries:
   Is 4 even? [isEven(4)/]
   Is 7 even? [isEven(7)/]

3. String Queries:
   [fullName('John', 'Doe')/]
   [greeting('World')/]

Queries are useful for:
- Encapsulating reusable logic
- Improving template readability
- Centralizing common calculations
[/template]
